  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Greater Dhaka Sustainable Urban Transport Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to develop a sustainable urban transport system (UTS) in GCC, which forms part of north Greater Dhaka, through the delivery of a 20-kilometer (km) bus rapid transit (BRT) corridor. This pilot project provides a holistic solution for integrated urban mobility, bearing a demonstration effect as no modern mass transit system exists in Bangladesh yet.</narrative>
  </description>
